BT /F1 10 Tf 56 560 Td (The elevated decline rate increased from 2.1% to 9.8% during the incident window. Legitimate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 546 Td (merchants experienced payment failures, reducing transaction success rates and creating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 532 Td (customer friction. The fraud-scorer service remained operational but was miscalibrated, causing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 518 Td (unnecessary payment rejections.) Tj ET
